egory_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"sB4xcTwwCO8IHiK15VDC_A","review_id":"SdUhecTnQ6Fjd1aM2xyvpQ","date":"2014-07-06T18:02:38","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9410692453384399,"text_excerpt":"Plum Street is the first snowball stand I've ever seen with the Chinese take-out pails. A little unorthodox, but the bag so it doesn't spill all over you makes up for it. I never have to choose anymore because I just use my souvenir cup! Yay for being a consistent customer! I have tried a bunch of flavors, but I have discovered that I hate condensed milk and cream flavors - yuck! Way to heavy for something already rating far above my acceptable sugar levels. My SO lives less than a block away from Plum Street, so I have now experienced the joy of being able to get a snowball whenever I want, but with the selectivity to be able to peak out the door to see when the line isn't outrageous and..."},{"business_id":"sB4xcTwwCO8IHiK15VDC_A","review_id":"_vcidhKjhbz8tnvOPaUcBg","date":"2019-07-27T03:33:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9360066652297974,"text_excerpt":"If you're going to have a Snoball in NOLA, and let's face it - you HAVE to have a Snoball in NOLA at least once a summer because I think it's some sort of law here - then please do yourself a favor and make it a Plum Street Snoball. The prices are excellent, the ice is powdery, and I've loved every flavor I've ever tried. My favorite is their chocolate with sweetened condensed milk. It's rich, sweet, and perfectly chocolatey. And if nectar's your thing, go for it here. Theirs is delicious. Other notable info.: My sister in law swears by their vanilla, but being a total creature of habit, I can't leave without my chocolate. I believe her and am guessing that the vanilla is the bomb. Keep i..."},{"business_id":"sB4xcTwwCO8IHiK15VDC_A","review_id":"2ChoKYErjbyxS3yNrLEFzA","date":"2019-04-07T17:33:26","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9286371469497681,"text_excerpt":"I've been living in NOLA for a while and I haven't gotten a chance to try this place out until yesterday!There was a line but it moved pretty fast. I will be definitely be going here or Hansen's now for snowballs. I got a small pail with half strawberry shortcake and half chocolate. My girlfriend got a small pail with root beer. I absolutely loved the flavors that I ordered. My girlfriend didn't like the root beer as much, but its okay. She said she'll just try out a different flavor next time. The ice was so soft. My girlfriend and I both agreed that we like the ice here better than Hansen's. Prices are very reasonable! It is cash only so be sure to bring cash! Be sure to ask for a bag i..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"sB4xcTwwCO8IHiK15VDC_A","photo_id":"lVLkHAPnSKuocueQQFXuVQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/lVLkHAPnSKuocueQQFXuVQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9053328633308411},{"business_id":"sB4xcTwwCO8IHiK15VDC_A","photo_id":"LCCclof8hE0-5ChBd_-5CQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/LCCclof8hE0-5ChBd_-5CQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8632356524467468},{"business_id":"sB4xcTwwCO8IHiK15VDC_A","photo_id":"PMsYJhDkKTXmzMtTXxrM1g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/PMsYJhDkKTXmzMtTXxrM1g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8221083879470825},{"business_id":"sB4xcTwwCO8IHiK15VDC_A","photo_id":"k5BC4FoG5GZ23ao1M9Y57g","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/k5BC4FoG5GZ23ao1M9Y57g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7341598868370056},{"business_id":"sB4xcTwwCO8IHiK15VDC_A","photo_id":"-8yzHwzpn6qWn6NCNP1Q5g","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/-8yzHwzpn6qWn6NCNP1Q5g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7288270592689514}]},"notebook_case":null}
